1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,562
Plot every pair as a dot and the scatter diagram tells you the story before any arithmetic.

2
00:00:06,562 --> 00:00:10,898
Dots on one rising line: perfect positive correlation.

3
00:00:10,898 --> 00:00:13,684
On a falling line: perfect negative.

4
00:00:13,684 --> 00:00:16,940
A tight rising band: strong positive.

5
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,856
A loose falling cloud: weak negative.

6
00:00:19,856 --> 00:00:22,044
A shapeless blob: none.

